WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.400
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.900
Right-click the task

3
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.500
Edit Task…

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Down to Depends On

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.600
Under Depends On, click Add

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.100
Pick the task it waits for

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.600
Save

8
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.700
Open the Gantt

9
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.300
Month fits both tasks on the screen

10
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:45.800
An arrow runs from the task it waits for
